          <li><strong>Company name / Legal entity:</strong> Buon Apeetito av.24 SL.</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Identification Number (NIF/CIF):</strong> B26841494</li>
          <li><strong>Registered and physical address:</strong> Avenida Mateo Bosch, 24, 07157 Port d'Andratx, Illes Balears, Spain</li>
          <li><strong>Business activity:</strong> Restaurant services, artisan pizzeria, and Mediterranean cuisine</li>
          <li><strong>Contact phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+34632446064" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">+34 632 44 60 64</a></li>
          <li><strong>Email contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Purpose and Scope -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
