        <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
          3. Terms of use of the website
        </h2>
        <p>
          The User agrees to make lawful, diligent, and proper use of the website's contents and services in full compliance with applicable law, moral standards, public order, and these terms. The following actions are strictly prohibited:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Causing damage, overload, or disruption to the servers or computer systems of the website.</li>
          <li>Introducing viruses, trojans, malware, or any other software capable of damaging digital systems.</li>
          <li>Attempting unauthorized access to restricted accounts, servers, or source codes.</li>
          <li>Using the website for unlawful purposes or activities contrary to the legitimate interests of Buon Appetito or third parties.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Intellectual Property -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
