        </h2>
        <p>
          All components forming part of this website (including but not limited to brand logos, trademarks, restaurant imagery, menu compositions, descriptions, graphic design, and underlying code) are the exclusive property of <strong>Buon Appetito</strong> or third parties who have authorized their use, protected by Spanish and international intellectual property laws.
