        </h2>
        <p>
          Buon Appetito makes reasonable efforts to ensure uninterrupted access and correct information on the website, but does not guarantee total absence of technical interruptions or temporary errors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Likewise, Buon Appetito accepts no responsibility for content, services, or links to third-party platforms (such as Google Maps, Instagram, or external booking channels) over which it has no direct editorial control.
