      </section>

      <!-- Section 6: Menus and Reservations -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
          6. Menus, pricing, and table bookings
        </h2>
        <p>
          Dishes, menus, and prices displayed on the website are provided for informational and indicative purposes. Buon Appetito reserves the right to adapt ingredients, fresh harbor fish availability, and prices according to seasonal market supply. Final table confirmations are agreed directly with our dining room staff.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7: Law and Jurisdiction -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
          7. Applicable law and jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          Any dispute or claim related to this website shall be governed by <strong>Spanish law</strong>. Both parties expressly agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the <strong>Courts of Palma de Mallorca (Balearic Islands, Spain)</strong>, waiving any other jurisdiction that might otherwise apply, without prejudice to mandatory statutory consumer rights.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

